{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk on the walls and ceiling as you solve physics puzzles, progressing through a series a test chambers. Push boxes and use them in combination with your rotation abilities to reach new areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your escape to the outside world\u2014but your journey doesn\u2019t end there. Use your abilities to traverse the massive underground facility and uncover its dark secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game will also include a feature-rich level editor (not yet implemented), and an original soundtrack by Criobite.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2055510/extras/7e1bc07765d00bab169f3ab1999fddac.avif?t=1756643748\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rotate: Collective</strong> is an expanded reimagining of our popular web game \u201cRotate\u201d, introducing new puzzle mechanics for even more mind-bending challenges!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2055510/extras/c160070a548cff12c36efc8eab688696.avif?t=1756643748\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2055510?t=1756643748","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2055510?t=1756643748","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2055510/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756643748","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2055510/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756643748","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"